---
import SectionIntro from "../ui/SectionIntro.astro";
import FHat from "../ui/FHat.astro";
---

<section class="section process">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow="How TER represents a decision"
      title="Agents decide from the world they perceive."
      description="TER distinguishes an agent’s model of reality and perceived feasible actions from the constraints reality actually imposes. Agents do not need to optimize or behave perfectly rationally. That distinction helps explain why agents can make decisions that make sense from their perspective and still produce unexpected, constrained, or failed outcomes."
    />
    <div class="process-layout">
      <div class="ter-band row-1" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" style="--row-accent: var(--accent)">
        <div class="ter-band-head">
          <span class="ter-index">01</span>
          <span class="ter-band-label">Agent perception</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ter-nodes">
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong>M</strong>
            <span>Model of reality</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ter-join" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong><FHat /></strong>
            <span>Perceived feasible actions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ter-band row-2" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" style="--row-accent: var(--violet)">
        <div class="ter-band-head">
          <span class="ter-index">02</span>
          <span class="ter-band-label">Selected action</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ter-nodes single">
          <div class="ter-node wide">
            <strong>C</strong>
            <span>Selected action</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ter-band row-3" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" style="--row-accent: var(--orange)">
        <div class="ter-band-head">
          <span class="ter-index">03</span>
          <span class="ter-band-label">Reality and outcome</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ter-nodes">
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong>F</strong>
            <span>Actual feasible actions</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ter-join arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong>O</strong>
            <span>Realized outcome</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol>
        <li class="row-1" data-reveal>
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Agents interpret reality</h3>
            <p>
              Information, beliefs, assumptions, expectations, and perceived
              possibilities shape how an agent understands the decision it
              faces.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="row-2" data-reveal>
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Agents select an action</h3>
            <p>
              The selected action results from the agent’s decision process
              using its objective, model of reality, perceived feasible actions,
              valuations, and time horizon.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="row-3" data-reveal>
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Actions encounter reality</h3>
            <p>
            Reality determines whether the selected action is actually feasible and what realized outcome follows under prevailing conditions. That outcome can then alter the conditions shaping future decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .process-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    column-gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    row-gap: 0;
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .row-1 { grid-row: 1; }
  .row-2 { grid-row: 2; }
  .row-3 { grid-row: 3; }

  ol {
    display: contents;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.8rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  li > span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  li p {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .ter-band {
    display: flex;
    grid-column: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.35rem;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 1.75rem 0 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .ter-band-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .ter-index {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ter-index::before {
    width: 0.4rem;
    height: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--row-accent, var(--accent));
    content: "";
  }

  .ter-band-label {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .ter-nodes {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ter-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 5.75rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--row-accent, var(--line));
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ter-node:not(.wide) {
    flex: 1 1 0;
  }

  .ter-node.wide {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 6.25rem;
  }

  .ter-node strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .ter-node.wide strong {
    font-size: 2.3rem;
  }

  .ter-node > span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.66rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

  .ter-join {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .process-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .row-1, .row-2, .row-3 {
      grid-row: auto;
    }
    .ter-band, li {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
    .ter-band {
      padding: 1.25rem 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
